# scripts/opcount: `llmbench bench replay N` reads one recorded exchange
# (eight text deltas) from its JSON line N times with recorded.Read and
# asks its request of a recorded.Replay by Generate (wf10 L3); the cost of
# one exchange is the slope between the two sizes. The control is hand
# Go: encoding/json into a struct, the request's SHA-256 digest compared,
# the deltas' text joined. The floor is one pass over the line's bytes.
unit exchange
sizes 20000 120000
args bench replay {n}
control benchmarks/llm/testdata/control
floor benchmarks/llm/testdata/floor
